#: src/admin/utils/data.js:209
msgid "<strong>Security:</strong> Hardened video links and captions in the Video Gallery block. A video title or caption can no longer run script when the lightbox opens, whether the gallery video is opened from the page or from the editor. Thanks to Patchstack for the report."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:210
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Show a YouTube channel or playlist, or a Vimeo profile, channel, group or showcase, as a gallery. New uploads appear by themselves. Vimeo needs no key. YouTube needs a free YouTube Data API key once, with step-by-step setup in the sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:211
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Choose how often the gallery checks for new videos (every hour, 6 hours, 12 hours or once a day), or click \"Check now\". If YouTube or Vimeo can't be reached, the last videos stay on the page."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:212
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Paste a single video's link and the gallery offers that creator's whole channel."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:213
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> The YouTube Shorts option (all videos, hide Shorts, only Shorts) also works for channel feeds."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:214
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Play in place. A video can play inside its own tile instead of the lightbox (YouTube, Vimeo, Facebook and video files), one at a time."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:215
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Feed alerts. When a feed stops updating, for example because of a wrong or expired API key, a used-up daily quota or a deleted playlist, administrators see a notice saying what is wrong and where to fix it. It can be hidden for a day, sent by email if you turn that on, and goes away by itself once the feed works again."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:222
msgid "<strong>Improvement:</strong> YouTube thumbnails use the best size that exists for each video, and the live page now shows the same thumbnail as the editor instead of a cropped, blurrier one."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:223
msgid "<strong>Improvement:</strong> Video SEO markup gives feed videos their real publish date."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:224
msgid "<strong>Improvement:</strong> When \"delete data on uninstall\" is on, deleting the plugin also removes the YouTube API key and the cached feeds."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:225
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Full-width galleries no longer stick out past the edge of the page in classic themes such as Hello Elementor, on computers with a visible scrollbar."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:226
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> The upgrade (checkout) window opens again; it could fail with a 520 error."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:227
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> The lightbox no longer keeps following the mouse after the button is released outside the window."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:229
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> The lightbox no longer conflicts with other plugins that also load Fancybox."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:230
msgid "<strong>Security:</strong> Hardened block CSS output."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:237
msgid "<strong>Update:</strong> Freemius SDK updated to 2.13.5."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:238
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> After activating the plugin, the page no longer says you are not allowed to access it. The Freemius opt-in now opens first, then the first page of the plugin."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:245
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Video play events for Google Analytics. A video now sends video_play when a visitor presses play, and video_watch_progress at 25, 50 and 75 percent and video_watch_complete when they finish. Works with files, YouTube and Vimeo. Facebook videos only report that they were opened."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:246
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Video events are also sent straight to Google Analytics when gtag.js is on the page, for example with Site Kit. Google Tag Manager is no longer needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:247
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Facebook Reel links now open as Facebook videos."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:254
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Editor Hover Tooltip Visibility — fixed an issue where the tooltip for the first row of videos in the gallery would be clipped by Gutenberg's block boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:255
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Editor Selection Border — fixed an issue where the blue selection outline would be hidden behind poster images in the editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:262
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Animated Album Filtering — switching album filters now features smooth FLIP layout transitions (sliding into place, fade-in, and scale effects) with zero external library overhead."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:263
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Editor Interaction & Double-Click Preview — single-clicking any video tile in the block editor selects it in the sidebar, while double-clicking opens the lightbox preview."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:264
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Editor Hover Tooltip Visibility — fixed an issue where the hover hint tooltip was clipped and hidden by thumbnail overflow boundaries in the editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:271
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Sort Order — show the gallery in the order you added the videos, or set it to Newest First / Oldest First and let the block keep it sorted automatically."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:272
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Row Alignment — when the last row of a gallery doesn't fill every column, align it left, center, or right instead of it always stretching to one side."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:273
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Per-Device Column & Row Gap — set the spacing between tiles separately for desktop, tablet, and mobile, the same way column counts already work per device."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:274
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Facebook Video Support — add Facebook videos to the gallery alongside YouTube and Vimeo, using Facebook's public embed player. No app or API key required."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:275
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> GDPR Consent-Gated Embeds — a Require Consent Before Playing option shows a consent overlay in place of the player until a visitor agrees, so no third-party cookie is set before that."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:276
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Google Analytics 4 Video Tracking — a Send Video Play Events to Google Analytics option pushes a video_start event (title, provider, URL) to window.dataLayer whenever a visitor plays a video. Works with GA4 or Google Tag Manager already on the site."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:277
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Cached Thumbnails — YouTube and Vimeo thumbnails are downloaded into your Media Library the first time they're needed and served from your own site after that, so a thumbnail can never 404 again just because a provider reshuffled its sizes. Warms up gradually, at most one new thumbnail per page view."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:278
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Load More Pagination — a Videos Per Page setting under Layout Settings starts the gallery with that many tiles and reveals the rest behind a Load More button. Off by default (0 = show everything) so no existing gallery's appearance changes on upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:279
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> YouTube Shorts Filter — show every video, hide Shorts, or show only Shorts, detected from the link itself with no API key needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:280
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Play Icon on Thumbnails — a play icon now sits over every tile by default, so a gallery reads as video content before anyone hovers or clicks. Its color, background, size, and hover zoom are all customizable under Style → Item, or it can be turned off entirely under Options."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:281
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Item Border & Shadow — Style → Item now has Border and Shadow controls for each individual thumbnail tile, the same way the overall gallery box already did."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:282
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Filter button active/hover colors — the Button Hover/Active Colors control under Style → Filter had no effect on the active (current) filter button, and could leave the hover color stuck on the Load More button permanently instead of only on hover. Both now behave correctly."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:283
msgid "<strong>Fix:</strong> Custom player controls in the lightbox — videos now consistently get the plugin's Plyr-based controls instead of occasionally falling back to the browser's default video controls."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:290
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Bulk Import — paste a list of video links, one per line, and the whole gallery is built with titles and posters filled in automatically via WordPress oEmbed."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:291
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Thumbnail Shape — tiles can be 16∶9, 4∶3, 1∶1 or 9∶16 instead of a fixed pixel height, so vertical Shorts and Reels are no longer cropped."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:292
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Video SEO markup (free) — each video gets Schema.org VideoObject JSON-LD so galleries can appear as video results in search."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:293
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Five ready-made sections — Video gallery with album filters, Course video library, Product demo showcase, Customer video stories, and Portfolio showreel wall."
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/utils/data.js:294
msgid "<strong>New:</strong> Added a Show Filter Bar toggle."
